@hostAddress = http://localhost:5252

### List all courses
GET {{hostAddress}}/api/courses

### Get one course
GET {{hostAddress}}/api/courses/1

### Create a course
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "SEC301",
  "title": "Web Application Security",
  "credits": 5,
  "capacity": 25
}

### Update a course
PUT {{hostAddress}}/api/courses/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Web APIs with ASP.NET Core 10",
  "credits": 6,
  "capacity": 30
}

### Create a course with invalid data (expect 400)
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "X",
  "title": "",
  "credits": 0,
  "capacity": 1000
}


### Delete a course
DELETE {{hostAddress}}/api/courses/3

Accept: application/json

### Enroll Ada in DB201 (expect 201)
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/courses/2/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": 1 }

### Enroll Ada in DB201 again (expect 409: already enrolled)
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/courses/2/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": 1 }

### Enroll Alan in DB201 (expect 201)
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/courses/2/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": 2 }

### Enroll Grace in DB201 (expect 409: course full)
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/courses/2/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": 3 }

### Enroll an unknown student (expect 404)
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/courses/2/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": 99 }

### List the enrollments of DB201
GET {{hostAddress}}/api/courses/2/enrollments

### Remove Alan from DB201 (expect 204)
DELETE {{hostAddress}}/api/courses/2/enrollments/2

### Enroll Grace in DB201 (expect 201: a place is free)
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/courses/2/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

### Search courses
GET {{hostAddress}}/api/courses?search=Web

### Filter courses by credits
GET {{hostAddress}}/api/courses?minCredits=6

### Get statistics
GET {{hostAddress}}/api/statistics

{ "studentId": 3 }

###
